    "section_accordion_eVtHNJ": {
      "type": "section__accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_item_7CKjgY": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What should I wear to this event?",
            "content": "<p>All are welcome to come as they are—<strong>no formal Hindu attire is required!<\/strong> We simply ask that you dress modestly out of respect for the temple and monks. Please no tank tops (or wear a shawl over your shoulders) and avoiding short shorts or skirts. <br\/><br\/>Many women choose to wear long skirts, while men often wear pants and normal shirts or kurtas and dhotis. <br\/><br\/>Sarees are, of course, welcome but not required. <br\/><strong><br\/>The most important thing is that you feel comfortable while honoring the sacred space. 🙏✨<\/strong><\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_emUQpJ": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is this program for? Do I need to be religious to join the program?",
            "content": "<p>This is a traditional Hindu event, complete with sacred rituals, Vedic chanting, and devotional celebrations. While you don’t need to be Hindu or religious to attend, we invite everyone to experience the beauty and depth of spirituality here at the temple. <br\/><br\/>The teachings are universal, and we’re happy to explain any aspects of the tradition and ceremony. Whether you come as a devotee or simply with an open heart, you are warmly welcome!<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_7TFdiQ": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the Temple handicap\/ wheelchair assessable?",
            "content": "<p><strong>Yes!<\/strong> Our temple is wheelchair accessible through a separate entrance. However, please note that we do not have an elevator to access the lower level. If you need any assistance during your visit, our team will be happy to help ensure you have a comfortable and enriching experience. Let us know how we can support you! <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_mQ3rJ9": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I sponsor the event from a far?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, you can absolutely <strong>sponsor the event from afar<\/strong>! We are grateful for any support, whether near or far, and would be honored to have you contribute to this special occasion. If you're interested in sponsoring, please reach out to us for more details on how you can be part of this meaningful celebration. Your support helps make this event even more impactful! <br\/><br\/>Official sponsorship link to come soon!<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_Bpxjbg": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will it be livestreamed?",
            "content": "<p><strong>Yes!<\/strong> We are excited to offer a <strong>high-quality livestream<\/strong> of the event, thanks to our new equipment and an incredible team behind the cameras. Whether you’re joining in person or from afar, we want you to have an immersive and uplifting experience. Tune in and be part of the celebration! <\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_a6Qb7Q": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I get to Elmira, New York?",
            "content": "<p>Getting to <strong>Elmira, NY<\/strong> is easy with several nearby airports offering travel options. Here's how you can plan your trip:<\/p><p><strong>Direct Flights<\/strong><br\/><br\/>The <strong>Elmira Corning Regional Airport (ELM)<\/strong> is the closest airport to the ashram, just a 15-minute drive away. While direct flights to Elmira may be limited and sometimes more expensive, you can fly to one of the following airports with direct flights to Elmira:<\/p><p>Detroit (DTW)<br\/>Orlando (SFB)<br\/>Punta Gorda (PGD)<br\/>Tampa (PIE) <\/p><p><strong>Nearest Airports<\/strong><br\/><br\/>Elmira Corning Regional (ELM) – 15 minute drive <\/p><p>Ithaca Tompkins International(ITH) – 45 minute drive <\/p><p>Syracuse Hancock International (SYR) – 1 hr 45 min. drive <\/p><p>Greater Rochester International (ROC) – 2 hour drive <\/p><p>Newark Liberty International (EWR) – 3.5 hour drive<br\/><strong><br\/>Coming from NYC<br\/><br\/><\/strong>Drive: 4.5 (depending on traffic) <\/p><p>Bus: There are affordable buses from NYC using OurBus. ($50, 5.5 hours)  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ourbus.com\/\">https:\/\/www.ourbus.com<\/a><\/p><p>Flight from Ithaca: You can find a direct flight from NYC to the Ithaca Tompkins airport <br\/><br\/>Safe travels, and we look forward to welcoming you! 🙏✨<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_item_VUUMin": {
          "type": "accordion_item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the refund policy?",
            "content": "<p><strong>What is the refund policy?<\/strong><\/p><p>Request a refund at least <strong>14 days before<\/strong> the program start date to receive a <strong>100% refund<\/strong> of your payment.<br\/><br\/>If you request a refund between <strong>7-13 days before<\/strong> the start date, you will receive a <strong>50% refund<\/strong>.<br\/><br\/>Refund requests made <strong>less than 7 days before<\/strong> the program start date are not eligible, as program resources and preparations will already be in place.<br\/><\/p><p><strong>How to Request a Refund:<\/strong><\/p><p>To request a refund, please contact our support team at info@bhaktimarga.us with your registration details. Refunds will be processed to the original payment method within <strong>7-10 business days<\/strong>.<\/p><p><strong>Exceptions:<\/strong><\/p><p>Refunds will not be issued for missed sessions, schedule conflicts, or personal circumstances. However, in cases of <strong>extraordinary situations<\/strong>, please reach out to discuss possible options.<\/p><p>We appreciate your understanding and look forward to supporting you on your spiritual journey with <strong>Bhakti Marga!<\/strong><\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
